# Enable the in-app "Report a bug" button: the server mints Vercel Blob
# client-upload tokens so recordings upload straight to your Blob store.
# Get this from: Vercel dashboard -> Storage -> your Blob store -> tokens
# (or `vercel env pull` on a project the store is connected to).
BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN=vercel_blob_rw_xxx

# Required — directory with your app's design-token sources (globals.css, tailwind.config, …).
# Single-package app: PIXEL_PROJECT_DIR=.
# Monorepo app package: PIXEL_PROJECT_DIR=packages/client
PIXEL_PROJECT_DIR=.
